@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam roundcorner 12
left to right direction
title Roadmap outcomes — delivered baseline and proposed follow-up
rectangle "Delivered baseline\nReleases through v1.2.1\nLater merged rename and documentation" as Baseline #E2E8F0
rectangle "Owner selects next goal\nScope, risk and evidence guide selection\nNo dates or release commitments" as Selection #DBEAFE
package "Proposed outcomes — independently selectable" {
 rectangle "DOC-001\nReview and adopt documentation" as Docs
 rectangle "QA-001\nRecord responsive and keyboard evidence" as QA
 rectangle "PDF-001\nVerify PDF layout with representative resumes" as PDF
 rectangle "OPS-001\nRehearse coordinated restore and agree targets" as Ops
}
rectangle "Outcome acceptance\nAgreed criteria + relevant evidence\nResidual work recorded in the backlog" as Acceptance #DCFCE7
rectangle "Release decision\nOnly when release criteria are met" as Release
Baseline --> Selection : starting point
Selection --> Docs
Selection --> QA
Selection --> PDF
Selection --> Ops
Docs --> Acceptance
QA --> Acceptance
PDF --> Acceptance
Ops --> Acceptance
Acceptance --> Release : when applicable
note bottom of Selection
 Arrows show planning and acceptance flow.
 They do not prescribe chronological order,
 dependencies between outcomes, or deadlines.
end note
@enduml